WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.870
A market, in three sentences:

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:05.170
«Le marché est grand.» «Il y a des fruits

3
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.790
et des gens.» «C'est
bruyant.» Nothing is wrong.

4
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.570
Yet can you picture a single stall?

5
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.830
Or a story begins: «Il
pleuvait depuis le matin».

6
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.190
An almost empty platform.

7
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.500
Then a voice: «Tu ne me reconnais pas ?»

8
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.480
How do you make a reader see a place

9
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.420
or follow a story, in a few
hundred words of French?

10
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.030
In this mission, you'll
set a photo beside a film

11
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.980
strip in Mission D1, and
rebuild a plain draft.

12
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:36.430
Then you'll pin a story's events
onto the timeline in Mission D2.

13
00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.920
Your mission: find out
how to put your reader

14
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.990
right there on that platform.
